Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,No guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:10.11,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,It seems too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.29,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.14,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Your Highness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.21,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.76,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,R-Run, Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:35.05,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,He... Julius...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.16,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Called upon dark power...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:44.55,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Hello, Philia, my destined one...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.02,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:11.94,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(710,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&HDA8FA9&}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside\Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.94,0:01:11.94,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(960,1)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:21.12,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(500,283.044)}Episode 11\N "Archdemon {\fs12\c&H4E04D4&}Asmodeus{\c&HF9F8FA&\fs10}"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:30.24,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Philia, I see you still have that \Nbeautiful silver hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:33.54,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,And, of course, the most \Nbeautiful soul of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:37.67,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You truly should belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:43.43,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Asmodeus... For what reason are \Nyou impersonating Prince Julius?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.02,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,No particular reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:52.39,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,But for our love to thrive, I thought \Nyou would find it more convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:54.44,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,if I were a human rather than a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:58.40,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia, what's happened to Prince Julius?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.96,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,He's been possessed by Archdemon Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:07.73,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I'm sure that that fool of a prince,\N out of all possible options,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:10.25,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,invoked forbidden power \Nto get out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:13.52,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You've got an exorcist as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.96,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Hey, been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.37,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Old Man Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:21.09,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,You're looking pretty handsome today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.90,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Mammon, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.90,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You've been reduced to serving \Nas an exorcist's familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:27.68,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.76,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:33.94,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,It must be hard to hear my romantic \Novertures with all this noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.90,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Therefore, I intend...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:40.22,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,to destroy everyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.00,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.54,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Asmodeus's shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.43,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Low-ranking demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.75,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.10,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:13.14,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Mammon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.35,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,You got it, Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.76,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Exorcism technique: Demon-Devouring Crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:32.96,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Oh, Mammon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:36.48,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,You're so much cuter in that form!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:40.09,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,You think I'm a pet or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.51,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,We'd better get in there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:46.89,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,It's time to debut the anti-demon weapons \Nthat Saint Philia developed for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.31,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:52.73,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Ninja technique: Art of Fire Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:00.15,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,When it comes to cleaning up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.15,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm very thorough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.03,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.53,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,In all respects, we must be flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.76,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I'm Saint Philia's butler, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.50,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:17.83,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,This is quite a halberd you made, Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.77,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,A-Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.75,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Aunt Hilde!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:29.32,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia. Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:32.08,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I'm sure we have a lot of catching up to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.93,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,But let us focus on the enemy at hand for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:35.60,Default,Philia/Mia,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:42.11,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Honestly. I just wanted \Nto secure a quiet place to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:43.48,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,How obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:46.03,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.45,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia! Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:50.06,Default,Philia/Mia,0,0,0,,Holy Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.64,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.14,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.39,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Such power...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:23.27,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I'd expect no less of the archdemon that\Nnearly destroyed the world four centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:27.90,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,But if he's using a human host, \Nhis revival isn't complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:32.98,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Meaning this will be our \Nonly chance to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.91,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're responsible for all of this. \NWe'll vanquish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:38.36,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You have me in a quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:42.62,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,I was hoping to preserve your beauty \Nin taking you back with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.97,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,I know. Why don't we try this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.22,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Holy Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:00.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Aunt Hilde!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:02.13,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:09.69,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Former saint of Girtonia, \NHildegarde Adenauer...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:13.07,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Not the hostage I was hoping for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.94,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Wow, Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:23.04,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,It looks like this woman's \Nput you through quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:27.75,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,I can look through the memories \Nof any human I touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.39,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Hildegarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:33.97,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You're keeping a secret \Nfrom Philia, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:36.73,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!\N She doesn't need to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:41.60,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Philia, if you want to save your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.94,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,you'll come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.48,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,My... mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:08:02.15,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,The people you {\i1}thought{\i0} were your \Nparents stole you from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:04.71,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,all to preserve their family line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:11.09,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,And it seems your little sister knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:12.93,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:14.68,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Abandon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.35,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I abandoned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:21.39,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,A mother who'd abandon her daughter \Nhas no right to call herself one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:24.39,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.44,Flashback,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.55,Flashback,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,What matters most to a saint is her kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.45,Flashback,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,You must always put your people first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.52,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, Teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:41.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}All this time, I've followed \Nher teachings as a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:42.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.21,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,What is it {\i1}you{\i0} want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:48.21,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,What's right or wrong \Nisn't important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:52.71,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Search deep inside you \Nand tell me what you really want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:56.42,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will not abandon you, Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.10,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.10,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.60,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Come back, Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:05.19,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If Asmodeus gets his hands on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:07.78,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Mammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:11.23,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you really put me through my paces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.36,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.78,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Get down, Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:22.08,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Blast him! Dark Matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:28.30,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You think you're strong enough for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.09,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:33.58,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,That wasn't meant to beat you, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:42.22,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.69,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Begone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:50.22,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,fragile human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.53,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Erza!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:08.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:08.92,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:10.79,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:17.05,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,It seems I've damaged your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:22.05,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,No matter. I have a far better \Nvessel prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:26.18,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,One more befitting Fianna's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.79,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.53,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Now then, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.33,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,This is the worst possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:44.45,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If only I'd been stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:47.95,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,This can't be... My sister is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:56.98,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:06.81,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,As an exorcist, do you\N have the ability to locate her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.31,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:15.52,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Tell us! Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:21.26,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,If you refuse to reveal her whereabouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:24.12,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Himari, it's not nice to threaten people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.24,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.03,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,As great as my concern for my mistress is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:32.00,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,it may be difficult to maintain \Nmy gentlemanly composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:42.01,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Asmodeus's true form resides in Limbo,\Nbetween here and the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:50.48,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,He plans to use Philia's soul \Nto resurrect the legendary Archsaint Fianna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.15,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Hold out just a bit longer, Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:02.74,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Once your soul is released, \Nyou'll be freed from such bodily pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:10.25,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I can't hold on any longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:12.16,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Are you trembling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:13.75,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,You poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:26.61,Main - Top,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,What in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Saint Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:37.44,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Observing Mammon gave me the chance \Nto study the bodies of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.23,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,In addition to blood, you have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:42.44,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,a constant flow of magic power \Ncirculating throughout you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:45.41,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,So when I inject magic of my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:51.04,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,the two clash, temporarily\N interrupting that flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.04,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Philia...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.29,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Why... Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:13:02.69,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,Don't... Don't you see how much I love you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.55,Default,Julimodeus,0,0,0,,That's why I came to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.34,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:25.78,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Erza, you know a way\N to get to Limbo, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.20,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,What if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:31.60,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Demonic affairs fall under the \Njurisdiction of exorcists like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:36.21,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I can't have royals, or even saints,\N getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:42.84,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,As far as coming and going with\N my teleportation magic is concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:47.44,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,carrying you and Philia, \NI'd only be able to take one more person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:48.33,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Mammon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:52.30,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Look, you owe Philia your life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:57.14,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,You can see why someone'd \Nwant to save her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:01.58,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Then the answer is obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:03.23,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'll go to save Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:06.46,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's out of the \Nquestion, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.86,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,As Saint Philia's butler, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:11.16,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I cannot simply stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.42,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I must be the one to save my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:16.42,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It is my duty as retainer to save my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.62,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Let it be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:20.67,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,What's a maid if she's not \Nserving her mistress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.92,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Please take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.82,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Sh-Sheesh, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:29.60,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Not that I mind having pretty \Ngirls up in my face...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:30.68,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,This is Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.10,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:37.89,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Philia's talking out of my bracelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:44.32,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,I included a function to communicate through\N it via magic should such a need arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.26,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:47.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,How's your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:48.24,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,It's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:52.85,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have worried you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.49,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,We're just glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.83,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,You can get back to us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:14:59.56,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:01.96,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:09.28,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,This might be the last time we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.41,Main - Italics,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.97,Main - Italics,Osvalt,0,0,0,,What does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:15.97,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Before Asmodeus regains his full power...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I must destroy him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:19.34,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Don't, Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:23.15,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Not even you can defeat that awful monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:25.80,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will find a way, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:28.97,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's not completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.24,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Moreover...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:34.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It is my wish to return to Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:36.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:38.73,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:40.44,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.44,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I have so many questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:50.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But I'm genuinely glad to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.29,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.26,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,You've grown up very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.89,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,The things you taught me were priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:00.39,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will not let them be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.90,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.27,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:07.15,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I swear it... I swear I'm going to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:10.81,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Do you remember my offer to you that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:13.85,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Once this is all over...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:17.12,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Could we go out together again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.74,Flashback,Osvalt,0,0,0,,For a meal, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:22.47,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep my word! So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:32.01,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Erza!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:36.47,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Please, take me to Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:38.32,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:41.14,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I cannot grant that request, even to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:44.68,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I understand your reasoning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:49.35,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But the life of the person who \Nmatters most to me is on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:51.69,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,So I can't let that talk me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:54.85,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Is Philia so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:58.20,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,That you'd give your life for hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.71,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,You're damn right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.95,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\N I'm going to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:06.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Erza.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.52,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Please, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:13.78,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'd like to do it myself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:19.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Please take Prince Osvalt in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.26,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:26.11,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm throwing in my support, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:29.12,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt, go save Saint Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:31.89,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I defer to you, Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:36.70,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.41,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee you'll\Nmake it back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.08,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,We're off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:48.78,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:54.59,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Please, look after my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:56.64,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Ms. Hildegarde...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.18,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.47,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I swear I'll bring Miss Philia back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.64,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,So she can keep smiling with all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:07.73,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:14.11,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the smile that melted \Nthe ice over my sister's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.90,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,We'll handle these. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:23.78,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.39,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I don't need him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:52.90,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I won't get any further \Npossessing that frail shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.48,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,So this is your true form?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:18:59.92,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:03.91,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,It's been four centuries since \NI last faced you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.39,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Philia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:09.20,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,No, soul of Fianna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.86,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:17.51,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Do you know how I've waited these\Nfour hundred years to meet you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:21.05,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Now, let us spend eternity together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:25.47,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I have prepared the perfect body for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:32.01,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Two hundred years of craftsmanship \Nfrom the finest dollmakers...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:36.73,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,It took so much work to perfectly \Nrecreate Fianna's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:41.24,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.94,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,First, I'll move your soul to its new vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:48.87,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,then I'll draw out Fianna's\N memories embedded within.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:55.15,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I do dislike the use of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:59.45,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd offer \Nup your soul willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.14,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:07.01,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Now, will you save this man or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:09.00,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'm very curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:15.44,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Personally, I'd love to see you \Nabandon your once former fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.19,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Abandon him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:18.61,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:23.13,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,His unbridled jealousy led him \Nto heap abuse upon you for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:26.45,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,And then he sold you off like garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:30.52,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate anyone \Nwho'd treat you that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:34.82,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,So if you ask me to kill him,\NI will do so gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:42.82,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:45.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Release Prince Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:48.78,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You'd decide without hesitation, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.71,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Such unwavering strength of spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:54.52,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,That really is what I expect from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I won't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:59.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But first, release the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.98,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,No, I need to bind you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:06.49,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I can't have you channeling \Nmagic into me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:14.12,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Fianna! At last, I'll see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.81,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I won't let you have Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:42.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had faith, Prince Osvalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:44.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew that you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:48.91,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you, so eternally \Nforthright, are truly here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:54.38,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}then I have reason to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Next time, episode 12:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:37.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,"The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside \Nby My Fiancé, Now in Another Kingdom."
